<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>育才实验学校 · 校园测评中心 · 教师管理中心</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/school/school.css"/><!-- SCHOOL_BRAND_PATCH_V1 -->
<style>.school-ident{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;letter-spacing:0}.school-ident-image{display:block;width:210px;max-width:46vw;height:auto;object-fit:contain}.school-ident-sub{font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#3f3657;white-space:nowrap}@media(max-width:700px){.school-ident-image{width:145px}.school-ident-sub{font-size:13px}.nav{flex-wrap:wrap}}</style>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/assets/images/school-icon.png"/>
</head><body><main class="wrap"><header class="nav"><div class="brand school-ident"><img class="school-ident-image" src="/assets/images/school-title.png" alt="育才实验学校"/><span class="school-ident-sub">教师管理中心</span></div><div class="navright"><a href="/">返回测验首页</a><a href="/school/">学生登录页面</a></div></header>
<div id="adminError" class="note hidden"></div>
<div id="content"><div class="section-head"><div><h1 class="admin-title">学生账号与考试管理</h1><p class="subtitle">批量导入学生账号、发布考试／练习、按账号查看课堂数据。账号密码不在列表显示。</p></div><span class="label">教师 / 管理员</span></div>
<section class="card adminCard" id="rbacTeacherBlock" hidden><p style="margin:0 0 16px"><a href="/school/classes" class="primary" style="display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:10px">🏫 打开学校班级管理：新建、批量建班、教师分班 →</a></p><div class="section-head"><h2>⓪ 管理教师任教班级（仅管理员）</h2></div><p class="subtitle">管理员为教师分配一个或多个班级，未分配的教师无法管理任何学生；班级名应与学生账号记录一致。</p><form id="createTeacherForm" class="flex"><input id="newTeacherUser" required placeholder="新教师登录账号" minlength="3" maxlength="32" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9_.-]+"/><input id="newTeacherPass" type="password" required minlength="8" placeholder="初始密码（至少8位）"/><button type="submit" class="primary">创建教师账号</button></form><p id="teacherClassHint" class="muted" style="margin-top:12px"></p><div id="teacherList"></div><hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid #e7e5f3;margin:18px 0"/><h3>移交已有测验任务</h3><p class="muted">可把以前由管理员发布的任务移交给指定教师及任教班级。</p><form id="transferAssignmentForm" class="flex"><input id="transferCode" maxlength="4" pattern="[A-Za-z]{4}" required placeholder="4位自主测验码"/><select id="transferTeacher" required></select><input id="transferClass" required placeholder="所属班级全称"/><button class="light" type="submit">移交任务</button></form></section>
<div class="card adminCard"><div class="section-head"><h2>① 批量导入学生账号</h2><button class="light" id="templateBtn">下载 CSV 模板</button></div><p class="note">请用 Excel 按模板填写账号、密码、姓名、班级，另存为“CSV UTF-8”；允许学校统一设置密码，学生不能自行修改（建议每人使用不同密码）。重复账号会跳过，不覆盖已有密码。</p><label>选择 CSV 文件</label><input id="csv" type="file" accept=".csv,text/csv"/><div class="flex" style="margin-top:13px"><button class="primary" id="importBtn" disabled>开始批量导入</button><span class="muted" id="previewInfo">请选择文件</span></div><div class="bar" style="margin-top:12px"><div id="importBar" style="width:0"></div></div><p id="importInfo" class="muted"></p><div id="preview" class="tablewrap"></div></div>
<div class="card adminCard"><div class="section-head"><h2>② 学生账号管理</h2><span id="totalAccounts" class="label">加载中</span></div><div class="flex"><input id="search" placeholder="搜索账号、姓名或班级" style="min-width:270px;flex:1"/><button class="light" id="searchBtn">查询</button><button class="light" id="reloadBtn">刷新</button></div><div class="tablewrap" style="margin-top:16px"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>账号</th><th>姓名</th><th>班级</th><th>状态</th><th>密码管理</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody id="accountsBody"></tbody></table></div><div class="flex" style="justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:14px"><button class="light small" id="prevPage">上一页</button><span id="pageText" class="muted"></span><button class="light small" id="nextPage">下一页</button></div></div>
<!-- SCHOOL_DOCUMENT_QUESTION_IMPORT_V1 -->
<div class="card adminCard" style="margin:14px 0"><div class="section-head"><h2>📄 Word / Excel 智能导入题库</h2><a class="primary" href="/school/import" style="text-decoration:none">打开智能导题工作台 →</a></div><p class="subtitle">上传DOCX/XLSX，自动识别选择题、判断题、填空题和每题分值。逐题核对后直接发布账号考试或自主练习。</p></div>
<div class="card adminCard"><div class="section-head"><h2>③ 发布账号测验任务</h2></div><p class="subtitle">可输入4位字母的自主测验码，或从“保存试卷”获得的较长试卷ID。考试与自主练习都能发布；输入保存试卷ID时系统将自动生成4位正式测验码。实时主持房间码不能用于账号考试。</p><form id="assignmentForm" class="grid"><div><label>自主测验码 / 已保存试卷 ID</label><input id="quizCode" placeholder="例如 JNEH 或 JWTIOI" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9]{4,16}" maxlength="16" title="填写4位字母自主测验码，或4至16位已保存试卷ID（非主持房间码）" required/><div class="muted" style="font-size:12px;margin-top:5px">支持4位字母码及较长保存试卷ID；系统自动生成账号考试码。</div></div><div><label>任务名称</label><input id="quizTitle" placeholder="七年级信息科技单元测验" required/></div><div><label>答题模式</label><select id="mode"><option value="exam">考试（每个账号仅完成一次）</option><option value="practice">自主练习（允许再次练习）</option></select></div><div><label>指定班级（留空为全校）</label><input id="targetClass" placeholder="例如 七年级1班"/></div><div style="grid-column:1/-1"><button class="primary">发布任务</button><span class="muted" id="assignmentMsg" style="margin-left:10px"></span></div></form><div class="tablewrap" style="margin-top:15px"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>测验码</th><th>名称</th><th>模式</th><th>开放班级</th><th>状态</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody id="assignmentBody"></tbody></table></div></div>
<div class="note">提示：现有 Quizzle 的原始公开答题入口仍然保留。这套账号门户适合学校内部课堂测评；涉及严肃考试、防作弊或校外访问时，需要进一步封闭旧入口、启用 HTTPS 并进行安全验收。</div></div><footer>账号保存在教师电脑 Docker 数据卷中。请定期备份数据卷，学生密码以加盐哈希保存，教师不能查看原密码。</footer></main><script src="/school/admin.js" defer></script><script src="/school/teacher-roles.js" defer></script><script src="/school/admin-dashboard-plus.js?v=2" defer></script><!-- SCHOOL_TEACHER_UX_V2 --></body></html>
